      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks for pointing out those flaws, that's really helpful for my rebuttal section. To make sure I don't miss anything, can you elaborate a bit more on the actual claims regarding the specific genes you mentioned? For instance, what exactly do proponents of this view argue about the distribution of the BDNF gene or the APOE gene across different racial groups? I want to be able to describe their specific 'scientific' conclusions accurately before I tear them down in the debate.",
